CHAPTER.VERS:
Have you

          {+}
         not read even this Scripture: The stone which the builders rejected, The same was made the head of the corner;

But he, knowing their hypocrisy, said to them, Why do you

          {+}
         make trial of me? Bring me a denarius, that I may see it.

Jesus said to them, Is it not for this cause that you

          {+}
         err, that you

          {+}
         don't know the Scriptures, nor the power of God?

But as concerning the dead, that they are raised; have you

          {+}
         not read in the Book of Moses, in [the place concerning] the Bush, how God spoke to him, saying, I [am] the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob?

He is not the God of the dead, but of the living: you

          {+}
         do greatly err.

And he called to him his disciples, and said to them, Truly I say to you

          {+}
        , This poor widow cast in more than all those who are casting into the treasury:
